cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Beyond the Streetlight
abstract: >-
  Materials for Christopher Carroll's discussion of Corrado, Kennickell and
  Cajner, "Beyond the Streetlight: Economic Measurement in the Division of
  Research and Statistics at the Federal Reserve", at the Federal Reserve's
  R&S Centennial Conference (November 2023). The code analyzes the trend in the errors of the
  Tealbook/Greenbook (GB) and Survey of Professional Forecasters (SPF)
  forecasts of the unemployment rate and of real growth in personal
  consumption expenditures from 1982 to 2017.
